{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":197,"count":23,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-13\",\"明天见\",\"明天見\",\"明天见\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"好，明天見。","pinyin":"Hǎo, míngtiān jiàn.","english":"Okay, see you tomorrow.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-2-14\",\"西子灣\",\"西子灣\",\"西子湾\",\"Name\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"西子灣(Sizihwan), a Kaohsiung bay: 灣(bay); the view is likened to 西子, the beauty Xishi."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-3-13\",\"小籠包\",\"小籠包\",\"小笼包\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你剛吃完二十個餃子，就接著吃小籠包，真的吃得下嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-08","sourceFront":"接著","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家店正在推銷巧克力口味的小籠包，我們要不要去嘗試一下？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-24","sourceFront":"嘗試","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"小(small) + 籠(steamer basket) + 包(bun) → small-basket buns: 小籠包 are soup dumplings."},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-10\",\"小朋友\",\"小朋友\",\"小朋友\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小朋友！別吵架、別打架了，有話好好地說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-10","sourceFront":"小朋友","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小朋友！別吵架、別打架了，有話好好地說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-09","sourceFront":"打架","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"危險物品必須放在小朋友伸手拿不到的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-18","sourceFront":"伸手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的小朋友很討厭打針，一看見護理師拿針筒(medical syringe)的樣子就哭了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-38","sourceFront":"打針","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-09\",\"表面\",\"表面\",\"表面\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"地球的表面大約百分之七十是水，百分之三十是地。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-09","sourceFront":"表面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天開會時，經理表面上對老闆很客氣，其實心裡很不高興。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-10","sourceFront":"上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"不要僅根據表面來判斷一個人或一件事，得花時間深入瞭解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-14","sourceFront":"判斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 表(form) and 面(face): 表面 means surface."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-28\",\"事實\",\"事實\",\"事实\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小偷：我又沒偷東西，為什麼抓我？ 警察：你先別動，只要看了商店攝影機錄下來的內容，就知道事實了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-28","sourceFront":"事實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有人以為身體沒什麼毛病就代表很健康，這樣的想法事實上不完全正確。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-06","sourceFront":"事實上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"Combining 事(affair) and 實(real): 事實 means fact."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-21\",\"建設\",\"建設\",\"建设\",\"V/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"像機場、高鐵、捷運這類公共交通建設，都需要很多經費才能完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這幾年由於市長積極實行交通建設計畫，使當地交通情況明顯改善了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-24","sourceFront":"明顯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次座談會邀請了各領域的人們，主要目的是對國內的地方建設提一些建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-38","sourceFront":"座談會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 建(build) and 設(build): 建設 means build."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-07\",\"汇款\",\"匯款\",\"汇款\",\"V-sep/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在這家網路書店購買商品，顧客得先匯款。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-07","sourceFront":"匯款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一般購物網站都是等收到顧客的匯款後，才寄出商品的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-07","sourceFront":"匯款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"國內幾家銀行決定從明年起，降低跨行匯款的手續費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-26","sourceFront":"跨行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-18\",\"身分\",\"身分/身份\",\"身分/身份\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一個人的想法會隨著身分、角色的不同而改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-18","sourceFront":"身分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"身分證是用來證明一個人的身分時使用的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-21","sourceFront":"身分證","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"去郵局領包裹的時候，記得帶身分證、圖章還有通知單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-01","sourceFront":"包裹","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-37\",\"吨\",\"噸\",\"吨\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這輛卡車有十二個輪子，大約能載二十五噸的物品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-37","sourceFront":"噸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-24\",\"价值\",\"價值\",\"价值\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這棟房子空間小，位置離市區又遠，所以價值三百萬而已。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-24","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這項研究計畫只針對少部分區域實驗，參考價值不高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-13","sourceFront":"區域","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"用人類的角度去看大自然， 就看不出大自然的本來價值。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-11","sourceFront":"本來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每個時代都有自己的價值標準，社會習俗及生活規矩也常隨著時代改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-15","sourceFront":"規矩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"博物館內的藝術品價值都很高，不小心弄壞了可是要賠償不少錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-09","sourceFront":"賠償","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"博物館裡的東西非常寶貴， 它們具有民族和文化的價值， 沒辦法用錢算清楚的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每個人的生命價值都是一樣的，不應該為了自己的利益而犧牲別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"奇怪\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"奇(strange) + 怪(strange) → 'strange-strange': 奇怪 means odd."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"抱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Extending a gentle 扌(hand) to 包(wrap) your arms warmly around someone is to 抱(hold)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"拒絕\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 拒(defend) and 絕(cut): 拒絕 means reject."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"準備\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"準(accurate) + 備(prepare): get everything accurately ready → to prepare."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"熱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 埶(art) rests deep in the warm 灬(fire) → glowing 熱(hot)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"箱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Two 竹(bamboo) strips cross toward each other in a 相(mutual) weave, and that woven overlap closes tight as a 箱(box)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"考試\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"考(test) + 試(try) → an exam tests and tries you."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"花\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) transforms with 化(change) into a 花(flower)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"這麼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"這(this) + 麼(particle) → 'this way', so 'so'."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"閱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"At the 門(door), a 兌(exchange) of documents happens — you check each one → 閱(examine)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"願望\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 願(desire) and 望(expect): 願望 means wish, hope."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"颱\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Fierce howling gusts of stormy 風(wind) batter the coastal observation 台(platform) as a storm hits: 颱(platform)."}]}
